 k first\, so students can get their strokes down before going on the water
 . We’ll cover: Proper stance and balance Efficient paddle technique Turn
 ing and maneuvering Launching and returning to the dock River awareness an
 d safety basics Many people hop on a board and think they’re having fun 
 — but they’re working twice as hard as they need to. This class unlock
 s the “aha” moments that make paddleboarding smoother\, more efficient
 \, and way more enjoyable. Held right in the heart of downtown Petaluma on
  the beautiful Petaluma River\, this is your chance to build skills in a c
 alm\, supportive environment — and start feeling at home on the water. B
