 origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } Though we launch from the hear
 t of downtown\, the central turning basin offers a surprisingly serene set
 ting—calm water\, open sky\, and a sense of ease that feels far removed 
 from daily life. This all-levels\, 90-minute session is designed for every
 one: experienced yogis\, seasoned paddle boarders\, and complete beginners
  alike. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778108630847_1898 { --stroke-style: none\;--s
 troke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-background-color: initial\; } #b
