 idth: 767px) { #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778108630847_1898 .sqs-html-content { 
 } } @media screen and (max-width: 767px) { } Poses are modified to make th
 em more approachable while floating on the water on anchored boards. We be
 gin with a short\, gentle paddle from the docks to get comfortable on your
  board (knees are always welcome). Once we reach our practice spot\, we an
 chor together so tidal movement won’t interrupt your flow. From there\, 
 you’re invited to move\, breathe\, rest\, or simply be—guided by an ex
 perienced instructor and supported by the shared rhythm of water and commu
 nity. All equipment is provided\, including extra-stable paddleboards meas
 uring 34 inches wide and 11 feet long—much larger than a yoga mat and de
 signed to help you feel grounded and secure on the water. Come as you are.
  Choose your own level of effort. Flow with the river and the people aroun
 d you. You deserve it. It’s YOUR river. Come out and play. $50/person\, 
 includes all gear\, instruction\, and quality time on the water. #block-yu
