DESCRIPTION:Upstream High Tide Paddle [High Tide: ~5.4 feet] When the tide
  rises\, the river reveals a hidden world. Join The Floathouse crew for a 
 gentle\, guided paddle upstream on a high tide of 5.4 feet \, when the Pet
 aluma River opens into its quieter\, greener reaches. With extra water ben
 eath us\, we’re able to glide beyond the downtown channel and into a tra
 nquil tidal slough—an ever-changing habitat rich with birdlife and natur
 al beauty. $60/person includes gear\, guide and nature’s awesomeness. #b
