 hour glide downriver in Hobie pedal kayaks—powered by your legs and the 
 outgoing tide. This slow-lane journey follows the Petaluma River south of 
 town\, slipping quietly through hidden wetlands and tidal habitat that mos
 t people never see\, and that can’t be accessed any other way. #block-yu
