 (--scale-x)\, var(--scale-y)) skewX(var(--skew-x)) skewY(var(--skew-y))\; 
 transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } The scale of the riv
 er as you float the six miles from downtown Petaluma to Lakeville Landing 
 Marina is astounding. We are all specks—very lucky specks —to witness 
 the wetlands from the water. As the tide carries you along\, you’ll peda
 l approximately six miles \, moving effortlessly through a living landscap
 e of reeds\, birds\, and broad skies. Egrets lift off ahead of you\, heron
 s stand sentinel along the banks\, and the river widens into its wilder se
 lf. Along the way\, we’ll share stories of this working tidal slough—i
 ts ecology\, its rhythms\, and why this stretch of river matters. At the f
 inish\, reward yourself with the optional Refresh Sesh at Sundrop Sauna . 
 Step into the heat\, rinse\, reset\, and leave feeling energized—inside 
 and out. Beginner-friendly. Unforgettable. Be part of nature—and let the
  tide do the work. Book here. ($85 for downriver run\, $125 for downriver 
 run + sauna refresh sesh) Includes all gear\, snacks and drinks at the sau
 na\, and sauna &amp\; cold plunge experience. Bring towel\, swimming suit\
 , slides. Hobie pedal kayaks provided. Transportation details\, meeting po
 int\, and sauna timing shared after registration. Note: Most folks arrange
  for their own transportation back to town\, but with advance notice\, one
  of our staff members or volunteers can give you a ride. #block-yui_3_17_2
