 width: 767px) { } There’s nothing as entertaining as hearing folks from 
 the past explain how things used to be—here guests learn about oyster sh
 ell processing on the Petaluma River\, an enterprise that continued for mo
 re than a century. Hear stories from people who worked the egg trade\, ran
  messages between businesses\, managed boarding houses\, and built enterpr
 ises that fueled a growing city. As you move through downtown and along hi
 storic riverbanks\, you’ll gain a deeper appreciation for the ingenuity\
 , industrious spirit\, and daily lives that shaped Petaluma—and the rive
 r that made it all possible. No paddling experience necessary. All equipme
 nt and instruction provided. Just bring your curiosity—and be ready to s
 ee Petaluma through new eyes. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1778182927579_4668 { --s
